# Cursor adapter

`AGENTS.md` is the repository-wide canonical engineering source. Read it before
editing, then load the relevant document in `docs/engineering/` and the scoped
rules in `.cursor/rules/` for the files being changed.

This file intentionally contains no duplicate architecture, security, database,
or completion rules. If an adapter disagrees with `AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS.md` wins.
Run `git diff --check` and `make check` before claiming completion.
